Bugfix: Reject empty repository location files

An empty file passed via the `--repository-file` option or the environment
variable `RESTIC_REPOSITORY_FILE` was treated as the current directory.
Restic now reports an error if that file is empty or contains only
whitespace.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22051
